# 换行符策略：仓库统一存 LF，检出也固定为 LF（不再受 core.autocrlf 影响）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本必须用 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 可能出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件（明确标记，避免 text=auto 误判）
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
